e barricaded off and getting  yourself to level 3 leverage as quickly  as possible lets you get access to these  places quicker  now once you've busted into someone's  office you'll want to get into their  stuff you could spend your time looking  for a password for their computer or a  key code for the safe but you can always  hack your way through instead hacking  may not seem that important at the  beginning when pass codes are on sticky  notes attached to the screen but it's  great in the latter half of the game  when pass codes become harder to find  and some don't even give you the option  meaning your only choice is to hack  hacking is also pretty important if you  start installing alien powers into  yourself the more alien power you have  the more alien your DNA becomes and  eventually the station's turrets will  see you as a threat and shoot you on  sight  however a quick hack will fix that right  up letting you still use turrets for  yourself and then there's repair which  lets you fix up machines like turrets or  operators and broken power generators  but even more importantly you can repair  broken recyclers and fabricators you'll  need spare parts in order to repair  something so it's also a good idea to  get dismantle which lets you break down  the spare guns you pick up into parts  finally I would recommend putting points  into toughness which increases your  overall health pool it's pretty  important in the later half when the  enemies start getting real tough you  should also put points into physicians  so you don't have to use too many med  kits  and those are the neuro mods we think  you should get no matter what play style  you are going with use the rest of your  mods on whatever cool abilities strike  your fancy let us know what mods are  your favorites I personally like turning  the dead into my own private army and  for more videos on prey and our full  review stay tuned to game spot  you  [Music]
 

